@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@messageId = replace-with-local-message-id
@deadLetterId = 1

### 0. 管理员登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800000002",
  "password": "Test123456"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 1. 查询 Local Message
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/local-messages?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2. 查询 FAILED Local Message
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/local-messages?status=FAILED&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3. 查询单条 Local Message
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/local-messages/{{messageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4. 将 FAILED / DEAD Local Message 重新置为可发送状态
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/local-messages/{{messageId}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5. 人工标记 INIT / FAILED 为 DEAD（SENDING / SENT 不允许人工撤回）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/local-messages/{{messageId}}/mark-dead
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. 查询 Dead Letter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dead-letters?status=PENDING&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. 查询单条 Dead Letter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dead-letters/{{deadLetterId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. 人工重试 Dead Letter
### 会重新走当前 AsyncOrderMessagePublisher：RocketMQ / Kafka direct 回对应 Broker，Outbox 才写 local_message。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dead-letters/{{deadLetterId}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 9. 忽略 Dead Letter
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dead-letters/{{deadLetterId}}/ignore
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 10. 标记已解决
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dead-letters/{{deadLetterId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 消息模式边界
### 默认 flash-sale 的异步创单命令走 RocketMQ Transaction Message，不通过 local_message。
### Local Message 仍用于领域事件和其他可靠消息；切换到 Outbox 交易命令模式时才会承载异步创单命令。
